{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09156","headline":"送郗詹事 · 韦应物","name":"送郗詹事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣朝列羣彦，穆穆佐休明。\n君子独知止，悬车守国程。\n忠良信旧德，文学播英声。\n既获天爵美，况将齿位幷。\n书奏蒙省察，命驾乃东征。\n皇恩赐印绶，归爲田里荣。\n朝野同称叹，园绮郁齐名。\n长衢轩葢集，饮饯出西京。\n时属春阳节，草木已含英。\n洛川当盛宴，斯焉爲达生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}